This adds two functions to `GenericContainer`:
```typescript
withCopyFileToContainer(sourcePath: string, containerPath: string);

withCopyContentToContainer(content: string | Buffer | Readable, containerPath: string);
```
Similar API also exists in the [Java library](https://javadoc.io/static/org.testcontainers/testcontainers/1.15.1/org/testcontainers/containers/GenericContainer.html#withCopyFileToContainer-org.testcontainers.utility.MountableFile-java.lang.String-).

This PR adds filtering support for full-text search queries.

```graphql
search(text: 'Channel', skip: 5, whereChannel: { handle_eq: "Bitcoin Channel" } ) {
  rank
  highlight
  item {
    ... on Channel {
      handle
      description
    }
  }
}
```

